WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
The home screen; the next game's hero is clicked to watch.

00:02.500 --> 00:10.000
The first fixture stream plays, with the details drawer open.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.500
A stall is injected; the picture holds its last frame.

00:17.500 --> 00:22.320
Failover to the second stream with no black frame; the drawer reports one recovered failure.
